      <data key="d2">A figure showing an arbitrary signal waveform that is difficult to describe mathematically.&lt;SEP&gt;A figure describing a non-periodic time function, specifically a voltage signal v_a(t).&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 1.2 is a referenced figure that contains the original arbitrary waveform from which the signal spectrum is derived.</data>
