    <node id="Mixed-Signal Design">
      <data key="d0">Mixed-Signal Design</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Also known as mixed-mode design, it involves designing systems with both analog and digital parts.&lt;SEP&gt;This is a technical topic mentioned in the broader discussions connected to the textbook's foundational reference.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-19dab0b0d0f5732d8dae08612cd92992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee9a50cff994f9381f5cb09c9bccc53</data>
