    <node id="Page 2 Marker (page_number)">
      <data key="d0">Page 2 Marker (page_number)</data>
      <data key="d1">page_number</data>
      <data key="d2">This is the pagination marker for the second page of the document. It follows page 1, which introduced signal spectra, Fourier series, and began describing a square wave example. Page 2 therefore contains the continuation of Section 1.2, including the visual spectrum (Fig. 1.5) and further elaboration on frequency-domain signal representation, serving as a direct sequential component in the chapter's technical narrative.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-abf71e9be0152596ec77f617bc3a5594</data>
