    <node id="Textbook Title Header - Microelectronic Circuits 5th Edition Volume 1 (header)">
      <data key="d0">Textbook Title Header - Microelectronic Circuits 5th Edition Volume 1 (header)</data>
      <data key="d1">header</data>
      <data key="d2">This is the main title header identifying the document as the first volume of the fifth edition of the textbook 'Microelectronic Circuits'. It provides the essential bibliographic context for all subsequent technical content, including the discussion on signal characteristics, spectral representation, and circuit analysis that follows. It establishes the source material's authority and subject domain.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-efeae5fd942b40f740df4f31c0b9e403</data>
      <data key="d4">RAG_test1.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1770441798</data>
