      <data key="d3">chunk-80e03064d4dac64b3d4a2275ef8afe38</data>
      <data key="d4">RAG_test1.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1770441798</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Chapter 1: Introduction to Electronics Header (header)">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 1: Introduction to Electronics Header (header)</data>
      <data key="d1">header</data>
      <data key="d2">This chapter-level header establishes the foundational framework for introductory electronics content. It organizes discussions about signal representation, Fourier analysis, and frequency/domain concepts that follow in subsequent sections. The header provides context for the transition from basic circuit exercises to sophisticated signal processing mathematics, serving as the primary organizational unit for all content from signal source analysis through frequency domain explanations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2355f4759811dfd4f5be72baace3411d</data>
      <data key="d4">RAG_test1.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1770441798</data>
