      <data key="d2">This is the page number '3', located in the top-right corner of the document's third physical page (page_idx 1). It marks the continuation of Section 1.2 'Signal Spectrum' from the previous pages. Its role is to provide document structure, enabling navigation and reference to content that further elaborates on signal representation, Fourier analysis, or related exercises and examples following the material on Pages 0 and 2.</data>
