      <data key="d2">This is the primary chapter title header for Chapter 1, which provides the foundational framework for the entire introductory unit on electronics. It encompasses all preceding discussions on signal digitization, binary systems, and ADCs, and introduces core topics like amplifiers and digital logic circuits. Its purpose is to formally demarcate the beginning of systematic instruction in electronic principles.</data>
