      <data key="d0">Odd Harmonic</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A harmonic whose frequency is an odd integer multiple (1, 3, 5, ...) of the fundamental frequency, present in signals with specific symmetries like the square wave.</data>
