      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The field of engineering that deals with the study and application of electricity, electronics, and electromagnetism, where Fourier analysis is commonly applied.&lt;SEP&gt;It is the academic discipline for which the textbook "Microelectronic Circuits" is a standard reference work.</data>
