      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The phase angle, represented by the argument $\omega t$, is the angle in radians that determines the point on the sinusoidal waveform.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1878e4e15958dba975a53e75f38c1afb</data>
      <data key="d4">RAG_test1.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1770442037</data>
