    <edge source="Symmetrical Square Wave" target="Fundamental Frequency">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">In the Fourier series representation of a symmetrical square wave, the fundamental frequency ω_0 is the lowest frequency component, related to the square wave's period T by ω_0 = 2π/T.</data>
      <data key="d9">base oscillation,spectral component</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-db51dd6aa7f66f035b774eb00b1181eb</data>
