    </edge>
    <edge source="Symmetrical Square Wave" target="Harmonic">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Fourier series representation of a symmetrical square wave consists of sinusoids at harmonic frequencies, which are integer multiples of the fundamental frequency.</data>
      <data key="d9">frequency multiple,spectral component</data>
