    <edge source="Image" target="Image Path">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Image is stored at the specified Image Path on the filesystem.&lt;SEP&gt;The Image is stored at the specified Image Path.&lt;SEP&gt;The Image is stored and identified by its specific Image Path.&lt;SEP&gt;The image is stored at the specified file system path.&lt;SEP&gt;The Image Path provides the file system location and name of the Image.</data>
