    <edge source="Image" target="Visual Analysis">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Image is the subject of a Visual Analysis that extracts its properties and context.&lt;SEP&gt;The Image is analyzed, resulting in the Visual Analysis data object.&lt;SEP&gt;The Image undergoes Visual Analysis to extract its metadata and structural information.&lt;SEP&gt;The visual analysis contains the extracted metadata and analytical data about the image.&lt;SEP&gt;The Visual Analysis data object contains and describes the metadata for the Image artifact.&lt;SEP&gt;The visual analysis provides metadata and analysis for the specific image.</data>
      <data key="d9">analysis,data analysis,description,evaluation,metadata,metadata extraction</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c8f2228a703be8bef62ad5b8318bb5af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f29b22be08d23160846f4c3cac8f32cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ba2ced186359c941c816e5e5eda762f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-905f3d2f135d774def7cdb42035893ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06ca6310ef4a9d4c86d66da037b22eaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2846e3e2abff26edef2b72a265a32e6</data>
      <data key="d11">RAG_test1.pdf</data>
      <data key="d12">1770442053</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Image" target="Footnotes">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Image has associated Footnotes, which in this case are reported as 'None'.</data>
      <data key="d9">annotation,supplementary information</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-06ca6310ef4a9d4c86d66da037b22eaa</data>
