    <edge source="Visual Analysis" target="Bounding Box">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation (Bounding Box, Visual Analysis) describes a structural and semantic connection within a data model. The Visual Analysis data object contains, includes, or specifies Bounding Box data. This Bounding Box data consists of coordinates that function as a component of the object's metadata, specifically categorized as spatial data. The primary purpose of this contained bounding box is to define an area within an image, specifying the image's spatial position or its particular area of interest. In essence, the relation indicates that spatial coordinate data defining a region is an integral part of the broader visual analysis metadata structure.</data>
      <data key="d9">data inclusion,image positioning,location coordinates,metadata,region definition,spatial data</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c8f2228a703be8bef62ad5b8318bb5af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f29b22be08d23160846f4c3cac8f32cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ba2ced186359c941c816e5e5eda762f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-480cc8d41c6788e0155f15c324b76647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff84b12278674a0234b8f4aeaf7eb163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80e03064d4dac64b3d4a2275ef8afe38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06ca6310ef4a9d4c86d66da037b22eaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2846e3e2abff26edef2b72a265a32e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f469fdb8dc12182ae82e11ccca8a78b</data>
      <data key="d11">RAG_test1.pdf</data>
      <data key="d12">1770442049</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Visual Analysis" target="Page Index">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation (Page Index, Visual Analysis) describes a consistent structural and metadata connection. The Visual Analysis, which is a data object containing an analysis of an image, systematically includes the Page Index. This index serves as a key piece of location metadata, specifically indicating the image's position within a larger document. Its primary function is to record the page number where the analyzed image is found, thereby pinpointing the image's location. Consequently, the Page Index is an integral structural metadata point recorded within the Visual Analysis object.</data>
      <data key="d9">data inclusion,document structure,location,location data,metadata,page location,page reference,positional data,positioning</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c8f2228a703be8bef62ad5b8318bb5af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f29b22be08d23160846f4c3cac8f32cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ba2ced186359c941c816e5e5eda762f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-480cc8d41c6788e0155f15c324b76647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff84b12278674a0234b8f4aeaf7eb163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80e03064d4dac64b3d4a2275ef8afe38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06ca6310ef4a9d4c86d66da037b22eaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2846e3e2abff26edef2b72a265a32e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f469fdb8dc12182ae82e11ccca8a78b</data>
      <data key="d11">RAG_test1.pdf</data>
      <data key="d12">1770442053</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Visual Analysis" target="Image Path">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Image Path is a key piece of metadata stored within the Visual Analysis data object.&lt;SEP&gt;The Visual Analysis data structure contains and references the specific Image Path.&lt;SEP&gt;Visual Analysis includes the Image Path as a key property of the analyzed image.&lt;SEP&gt;The Visual Analysis data contains and references the specific Image Path of the analyzed file.&lt;SEP&gt;The Visual Analysis object references the Image Path to specify the file location of the image.&lt;SEP&gt;The image path is a key piece of metadata contained within the visual analysis data.&lt;SEP&gt;The Visual Analysis data object includes the Image Path as a key piece of metadata.</data>
      <data key="d9">data inclusion,data reference,data source,file location,file reference,location,metadata,property inclusion,reference</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-f29b22be08d23160846f4c3cac8f32cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ba2ced186359c941c816e5e5eda762f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-480cc8d41c6788e0155f15c324b76647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff84b12278674a0234b8f4aeaf7eb163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80e03064d4dac64b3d4a2275ef8afe38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee9cc1a778c219c8048f09d3e7c84498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2846e3e2abff26edef2b72a265a32e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f469fdb8dc12182ae82e11ccca8a78b</data>
      <data key="d11">RAG_test1.pdf</data>
      <data key="d12">1770442053</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Visual Analysis" target="Captions">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation (Captions, Visual Analysis) describes how textual captions are structurally and logically contained within a data object or structure for visual analysis. The Captions are stored as a component of the metadata within the Visual Analysis data object. Specifically, the Visual Analysis data structure contains, references, and includes the Captions as descriptive text or a property that describes the content of the analyzed image. This integrated Captions data is extracted from the image and serves to annotate or summarize its visual content within the broader analytical framework.</data>
      <data key="d9">content association,content reference,data inclusion,description,metadata,property inclusion,reference</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-f29b22be08d23160846f4c3cac8f32cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ba2ced186359c941c816e5e5eda762f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-480cc8d41c6788e0155f15c324b76647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff84b12278674a0234b8f4aeaf7eb163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80e03064d4dac64b3d4a2275ef8afe38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee9cc1a778c219c8048f09d3e7c84498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2846e3e2abff26edef2b72a265a32e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f469fdb8dc12182ae82e11ccca8a78b</data>
      <data key="d11">RAG_test1.pdf</data>
      <data key="d12">1770442056</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Visual Analysis" target="Footnotes">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Footnotes are included as a metadata field in the Visual Analysis data object.&lt;SEP&gt;Footnotes are included as supplementary data within the Visual Analysis metadata, noted as empty.&lt;SEP&gt;Visual Analysis includes the Footnotes as a property, noting their absence in this case.&lt;SEP&gt;The Visual Analysis records the Footnotes (or lack thereof) for the image.&lt;SEP&gt;The Visual Analysis object includes the Footnotes data, which in this case indicates no footnotes are present.&lt;SEP&gt;The footnotes (or lack thereof) are recorded as part of the visual analysis data.&lt;SEP&gt;The Visual Analysis data object includes the Footnotes metadata field.</data>
      <data key="d9">annotation,content association,data inclusion,metadata,note reference,property inclusion,supplementary data</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-f29b22be08d23160846f4c3cac8f32cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ba2ced186359c941c816e5e5eda762f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-480cc8d41c6788e0155f15c324b76647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80e03064d4dac64b3d4a2275ef8afe38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee9cc1a778c219c8048f09d3e7c84498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2846e3e2abff26edef2b72a265a32e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f469fdb8dc12182ae82e11ccca8a78b</data>
      <data key="d11">RAG_test1.pdf</data>
